{"ID":"20240118144953-lmxze89","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144953-lmxze89","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144953-lmxze89\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144953-pu8m371\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170711-qqf01wi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:107,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170711-qqf01wi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:90,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:90\u0026#125;","title":"378补21郁金（玉金）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204170343"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144953-pu8m371","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144953-pu8m371","updated":"20240122170630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产四川广东及台湾琉球等地，为多年生之宿根草，根茎似芋，内暗褐色或黄色，其香能及远。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170632-1kjcj8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170632-1kjcj8p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛苦，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170634-dct85rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170634-dct85rt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】郁金为凉血破瘀要药，功能开血中之郁，泄血中之热，治吐血。溺血，恶血留积，失心癫狂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170636-ve51vsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170636-ve51vsp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【唐本】主血积下气，生肌止血，破恶血，血淋，尿血，金疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170637-sgazxnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170637-sgazxnt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】单用治女人宿血气心痛，冷气结聚，温醋摩傅之，亦治马胀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170639-63nkmv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170639-63nkmv8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】治吐衄，妇人倒经[1.益母草、郁金配伍治逆经。]，痘毒入心。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170641-bx6xezu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170641-bx6xezu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】凉心。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170643-bd69ha6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170643-bd69ha6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】治阳毒入胃，下血频痛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170645-l9flj2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170645-l9flj2x"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170646-prq9z44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170646-prq9z44"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡病属真阴虚极，阴分火炎，迫血妄行，溢出上窍，而非气分拂逆，肝气不平，以致伤肝吐血者，均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170630-rnexpzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170630-rnexpzp"}},{"ID":"20240122170647-fvi8oqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170647-fvi8oqc"}},{"ID":"20240122170647-hmd117l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170647-hmd117l","updated":"20240204170014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那第21味药，郁金。郁金呢也有人写成这样的玉金，也有人写草体、繁体字，写的很繁，反正都是郁金。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170655-ruv97we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170655-ruv97we","updated":"20240204170123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个郁金呢这个是味辛苦，性寒，是凉血破瘀的药，功能开血中的郁，里面小便带血，活血化瘀的药。我在治肝病的时候，最喜欢使用郁金，因为郁金不单单是活血，最主要它还散郁，散这个郁气，恶阻，这个人很恶阻郁气，得到病哦很恶阻郁气，郁闷，结气可以散掉，所以郁金吃了人会很开心，心情会比较好一点，那你要心情好一点，好。老师那我们前面学过合欢，合欢当然可以啊，合欢很好啊，合欢吃的人很开心嘛，那远志呢，远志也很好啊，远志除了可以强心以外，远志可以让一个人镇静不要焦虑，心情能够比较平和。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170700-49k59xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170700-49k59xv","updated":"20240204170255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"郁金，那剂量呢，你当然可以用三钱，严重的肝病的话用五钱，一般的肝炎的话用三钱，五钱、六钱、七钱都没有关系，因为你知道功能的时候，当你知道这个郁金可以开郁不要让一个人太恶阻压力不要那么闷，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那你开三钱下去他还在那郁闷，你就开五钱、八钱，因为你知道这个药可以解郁，你就开重嘛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对不对，不然的话，你不晓得那个药的功能是什么，你不会去加重它，那可以加这些药进去。那这个，你看它这个主治啊有没有，恶血留积，失心癫狂，我们都可以用郁金。所以郁金是非常好使用的一个药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170705-hn7r4ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170705-hn7r4ex","updated":"20240204170317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那【甄权】呢单用治女人宿血气心痛，女人这个情绪比较这个，张仲景特别有一章妇科的讲到女人，因为足不出户嘛，比较郁闷，气会郁结在身体里面，就会心痛，郁金能够散郁。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170711-qqf01wi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170711-qqf01wi","updated":"20240204170343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那【丹溪】治吐衄，妇人倒经，痘毒入心。这个倒经就是逆经从鼻子出来，我们前面有介绍一个叫益母草，对不对，益母草也是专门治疗女人逆经用的，那你可以配合郁金来使用，第28味充蔚子，又名叫益母草，本经里面是叫充蔚子。专门治疗女人经水逆流从鼻子出来，这里用了郁金这两味药可以合并在一起就可以治疗。"}]}]}